# Step 8.1 — teammate suggestions. Run `bun run dev`; VS Code "REST Client" keeps cookies.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@teamId = REPLACE_WITH_A_TEAM_ID

### Sign in as the team's LEADER
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "pat@example.com", "password": "REPLACE_ME" }

### Suggestions for the team's open seats: unteamed participants of the same hackathon, best
### first. { data: { method, team: { id, skillProfile, timezone: "UTC+05:30" }, suggestions: [
### { participant: { id, name, githubUsername, githubVerified: false, portfolioUrl }, score,
###   breakdown: { skills: [{ skill, teamLevel, candidateLevel, gain, reason }], skillGain,
###   timezone: { team, candidate, overlapHours, factor }, formula }, hasRequestedYourTeam }] } }
### Candidates who add nothing are included (score 0, ranked last).
GET {{base}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/suggestions

### Fewer results (limit 1-50, default 20)
GET {{base}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/suggestions?limit=5

### Not the leader → 403 NOT_LEADER; full team → 409 TEAM_FULL; unknown team → 404 TEAM_NOT_FOUND;
### limit 0 / 51 / text → 400. Rate limit: 20 calls / min per user.
